{"articleNo":"469384","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=469384&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2023년도 영·호남 상생 유공 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.11.15","hit":"6109","attachments":[{"name":"2023년 영호남 상생 장학생선발 계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=469384&attachNo=129130"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">▣&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -17.6pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">영</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -17.6pt; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -17.6pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">호남 화합과 지역인재 육성을 위해&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -17.6pt; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2023</span><span style=\"text-indent: -17.6pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 영</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -17.6pt; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -17.6pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">호남 상생 유공 장학생을 붙임과 같이 선발하오니 해당 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></b></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"text-indent: -17.6pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -17.6pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">지원대상</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">동서화합</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">인권신장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">평화정착 등에 노력한 대학생 또는 그 분야에 공적이 있는 사람의 대학생&nbsp;자녀</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">경북 출신으로 경북소재 대학교에 재학하고 있는 학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">경북 출신</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">: 2023</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">년</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월 현재 기준 대학생 또는 학부모가 주민등록상 주소지가 경북 관내인자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">신청기간</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">: 2023.11.15.(수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) ~ 11.23.(목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) 18</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">시까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">신청장소</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">군청 방문 또는 우편접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(11.23.(목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) 18</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">시까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">도착분에 한함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">제출서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</spa