 AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">붙임 참조</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">붙임 선발공고문</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
